template_content:
Send a WhatsApp follow-up to {{ phone }}{% if contact_name %} ({{ contact_name }}){% endif %}.

Purpose of the follow-up: {{ purpose }}

Write a short, friendly WhatsApp message (1-3 sentences) for this purpose, then send it with the send_whatsapp_message tool. The sending account resolves automatically from the logged-in user. If this starts a NEW conversation and the contact has not messaged in the last 24 hours, use send_whatsapp_template with an approved template instead of free-form text.
